{% comment %}
  Renders the PDP Luxury Steal / Final Sale badge, disclosure, real-inventory
  scarcity line, and the never-pre-checked acknowledgment gate that must be
  satisfied before add-to-cart (Slice 3 task 3-5,
  docs/specs/SLICE-3-LUXURY-STEALS.md §4.2-4.3 and §4.7, criteria 129, 130,
  133, 134, 143, 146, 148-149).

  WHY THIS RENDERS UNCONDITIONALLY REGARDLESS OF SECTION BLOCK CONFIGURATION.
  `sections/main-product.liquid` renders this from a fixed location BEFORE the
  merchant-configurable `section.blocks` loop (not from inside the
  `buy_buttons` block case), because the Final Sale disclosure and gate are
  policy-required, not optional merchandising -- they must not silently
  disappear if a merchant ever removes/reorders the `buy_buttons` block.
  Rendering first in `.product__info-container`, ahead of the title/price/
  buy-buttons blocks, also satisfies criterion 129's "conspicuous, not a
  footnote" requirement independent of however those blocks are arranged.

  THE GATE IS SCOPED TO THE SELECTED VARIANT (D27 / criterion 146), never the
  product. Selecting a non-assigned sibling variant must show nothing here;
  selecting an assigned one must show the full gate with the checkbox reset to
  unchecked. Same-product option changes re-render this whole partial via
  Dawn's Section Rendering API (`product-info.js` `handleUpdateProductInfo`),
  and `assets/luxury-steal-gate.js` swaps this container's markup from that
  fresh server render on the `variant-change` pub/sub event -- see that file's
  header comment for the full mechanism and its known limits.

  THE `.value` RULE (criterion 149) -- see `snippets/luxury-badge-card.liquid`
  and `snippets/price.liquid` for the same rule. `carat_ls_variant.metafields
  .carat.luxury_steal` ALONE is a metafield drop, truthy even when its value
  is `false` (unassignment writes `false`, never deletes -- criterion 128).
  Every read here goes through `.value`.

  THIS IS PREVENTIVE, NOT THE ENFORCEMENT (D6, spec §10). The order-time
  `orders/create` check (task 3-4) is what actually binds; this UI is the
  honest, accessible front door to it. A dynamic/accelerated checkout button
  (Shop Pay etc., `buy-buttons.liquid`'s `payment_button`) can bypass this
  gate entirely by design of that Shopify feature -- out of this file's
  reach without touching a Dawn file beyond the allowed single-line hook, and
  explicitly the gap the order-time check exists to cover.

  SCARCITY (criterion 130). "Only X left" renders ONLY when
  `inventory_management` is `shopify` (i.e. Shopify is actually tracking real
  inventory for this variant) AND `inventory_policy` is not `continue` (i.e.
  backorders are not allowed for it -- showing a countdown while oversell is
  permitted would itself be a misleading number) AND the live quantity is a
  real positive integer. Absent any of those, nothing renders -- never a
  fabricated or decorative count.

  NO COMPARISON PRICE OR SAVINGS CLAIM (criterion 132) is rendered anywhere in
  this file. That is a deliberate omission, not an oversight.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} Product Liquid object
  - section: {Object} the enclosing section (for id-scoping)
  - product_form_id: {String} the `<form>` id the buy-buttons snippet already
    rendered elsewhere in this section -- the hidden acknowledgment-id input
    below associates to it via the HTML `form=""` attribute, since this
    container is a DOM SIBLING of that form, not a descendant of it.

  Usage:
  {%- render 'luxury-product-gate', product: product, section: section, product_form_id: product_form_id -%}
{% endcomment %}
{{ 'component-luxury-gate.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- liquid
  assign carat_ls_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign carat_ls_assigned = false
  if carat_ls_variant.metafields.carat.luxury_steal.value
    assign carat_ls_assigned = true
  endif

  assign carat_ls_show_scarcity = false
  if carat_ls_assigned
    and carat_ls_variant.inventory_management == 'shopify'
    and carat_ls_variant.inventory_policy != 'continue'
    and carat_ls_variant.inventory_quantity > 0
    assign carat_ls_show_scarcity = true
  endif
-%}
<div
  id="Luxury-Steal-Gate-{{ section.id }}"
  class="carat-luxury-gate"
  data-carat-luxury-gate
  data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"
  data-product-form-id="{{ product_form_id }}"
  {%- if carat_ls_assigned %}
    data-carat-ls-assigned="true"
    data-shopify-variant-id="{{ carat_ls_variant.id }}"
    data-cart-token="{{ cart.token }}"
    data-error-text="{{ 'luxury_steals.acknowledgment.error' | t | escape }}"
    data-gate-hint="{{ 'luxury_steals.acknowledgment.gate_hint' | t | escape }}"
  {%- endif %}
>
  {%- if carat_ls_assigned -%}
    <div class="carat-luxury-gate__panel" role="region" aria-label="{{ 'luxury_steals.badge' | t | escape }}">
      <span class="badge color-{{ settings.sale_badge_color_scheme }} carat-luxury-badge carat-luxury-badge--pdp">
        {{- 'luxury_steals.badge' | t -}}
      </span>

      <div class="carat-luxury-gate__disclosure" id="Luxury-Steal-Disclosure-{{ section.id }}">
        <h3 class="carat-luxury-gate__disclosure-heading">
          {{- 'luxury_steals.disclosure.heading' | t -}}
        </h3>
        <p class="carat-luxury-gate__disclosure-body">
          {{- 'luxury_steals.disclosure.body' | t -}}
        </p>
        <p class="carat-luxury-gate__disclosure-claims">
          {{- 'luxury_steals.disclosure.claims' | t -}}
        </p>
      </div>

      {%- if carat_ls_show_scarcity -%}
        <p class="carat-luxury-gate__scarcity" role="status">
          {{- 'luxury_steals.scarcity.only_x_left' | t: count: carat_ls_variant.inventory_quantity -}}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="carat-luxury-gate__acknowledgment" id="Luxury-Steal-Acknowledgment-{{ section.id }}">
        <p class="carat-luxury-gate__acknowledgment-heading">
          {{- 'luxury_steals.acknowledgment.heading' | t -}}
        </p>
        <p class="carat-luxury-gate__acknowledgment-body">
          {{- 'luxury_steals.acknowledgment.body_html' | t -}}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-luxury-gate__control">
        <input
          type="checkbox"
          id="Luxury-Steal-Checkbox-{{ section.id }}"
          class="carat-luxury-gate__checkbox"
          data-carat-ls-checkbox
          aria-describedby="Luxury-Steal-Disclosure-{{ section.id }} Luxury-Steal-Acknowledgment-{{ section.id }}"
        >
        <label for="Luxury-Steal-Checkbox-{{ section.id }}" class="carat-luxury-gate__checkbox-label">
          <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'luxury_steals.acknowledgment.checkbox_label' | t }}: </span>
          {{- 'luxury_steals.acknowledgment.affirm_label' | t -}}
        </label>
      </div>

      <p class="carat-luxury-gate__status" role="status" data-carat-ls-status hidden></p>
      <p class="carat-luxury-gate__error" role="alert" data-carat-ls-error hidden></p>

      <input
        type="hidden"
        name="properties[_carat_ls_ack]"
        value=""
        form="{{ product_form_id }}"
        data-carat-ls-ack-input
      >
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
<script src="{{ 'luxury-steal-gate.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
